<td id="A4.T3.1.14.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">0.012</td>
<td id="A4.T3.1.14.8" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">0.970</td>
<td id="A4.T3.1.14.9" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">0.003</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A4.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_align_center">
<p id="A4.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">In this table, we detail the results that are presented in Section 4.3 in terms of needs category for the agents representing PEH per scenario. These results were obtained by modifyng the SAT matrix by calling deepseekr1 API with a temperature of 0.1 and using the prompt presented in <a href="#A3.SSx2" title="ABM Pipeline Prompt ‣ Appendix C Prompts for LLMs ‣ What Would an LLM Do? Evaluating Policymaking Capabilities of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
